\newlabel{fig:tool_usage}{{9}{26}{Tool-call distribution by configuration and tenant. Rows are grouped by tenant; columns show individual tools. \textsc {Researcher} (4o-mini) allocates calls across more tool types in every tenant, while the reactive configurations concentrate on \texttt {search\_messages} and \texttt {search\_people}. Cross-tenant variation is visible: ZAI's larger corpus drives higher \texttt {read\_file} usage across all configurations}{figure.caption.28}{}}
